", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=acMbowHk-JEQ7kNvwEMdidZ&_nc_oc=AdpxsgqvUrNeXf4PGTlVXTz7ve3Qi0z71wjBkujtovTZCpfKSKq3nqMfikowbDtE3Tc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6CMzwzWTCdSnt2A8UTrNnnSGjwPZ_pV9fHdD1W3Dc6-A&oe=6A0C67F9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yaGj9-ZzSDAQ7kNvwGGYlm_&_nc_oc=AdqCnWmoaOKCaSVacg3jCWxpyeHKPX3ISD8w1Vpsqt1y6N-7kL9EteYNAeptaPrqbWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6eXnkbI_uCh08ELBwOqVeRaW3ts-EEct_ywabeNAXVBg&oe=6A0C7ECB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8XfhyUH6hJAQ7kNvwHzMES4&_nc_oc=AdrVJ5l79GMqTYIJ9S8qlJ0NFJkMldvv-D2h3zPLCeXhBZBtK4v52MINbfNSSeAXRXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af57XvRGMly2JmK8ItMZ6kuUm8vo9LN9fHSaT6IabM4asw&oe=6A0C7D4E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel